# Build-context ignorefile for the distributed-kv image build.
# Used via `podman build --ignorefile examples/distributed-kv/.dockerignore` so
# the image build does not depend on the root .dockerignore. Mirrors the root
# one and additionally skips agent worktrees (multi-GB, actively written).
.git
**/.git
target
**/target
.qoder
raft-state-node*
